{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached, grab it, process it, and move it. Otherwise approach and grab visible object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = PutObjectDown    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsDestinationReached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
